      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:0",
          "text": "Play safe and farm until level 6, when Kayle becomes ranged. Before that she is a weak melee champion, so avoid long trades.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Kayle", "start": 39, "end": 44 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.38
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:1",
          "text": "Hit the enemy with Radiant Blast before you trade. It leaves them slowed and cuts their Armor and Magic Resist.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kayle-Q", "start": 19, "end": 32 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 66, "end": 72 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.27
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:2",
          "text": "Aim Radiant Blast at the first enemy in its path. It stops there, so a minion in the way takes the hit instead of your target.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kayle-Q", "start": 4, "end": 17 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.4
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:3",
          "text": "Keep attacking to build Zeal. At full stacks Divine Ascent gives Kayle extra Move Speed, so keep hitting while you chase or run.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Kayle-passive",
              "start": 45,
              "end": 58
            },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Kayle", "start": 65, "end": 70 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.14
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:4",
          "text": "Before level 6, use Starfire Spellblade to hit from a distance. Its attack is ranged, which lets you poke an enemy who would otherwise trade back.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kayle-E", "start": 20, "end": 39 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.51
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:5",
          "text": "Use Celestial Blessing on yourself to heal and run faster when you want to disengage or chase.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kayle-W", "start": 4, "end": 22 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.08
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:6",
          "text": "Cast Divine Judgment on yourself when the enemy focuses you. You can't be damaged, and the swords hit enemies around you when it ends.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kayle-R", "start": 5, "end": 20 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.09
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kayle:general:7",
          "text": "At level 11, fire waves from Divine Ascent hit everything in a line when you attack at full Zeal. Fight in lines of enemies and minions.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Kayle-passive",
              "start": 29,
              "end": 42
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.78
        }
      ],
      "combos": []
    }
  ],
